config BR2_PACKAGE_WT41N0_LOADER
	bool "wt41n0-loader"
	help
	  The small loader the Symbol monitor jumps to in place of the
	  stock OS entry point. It turns off the L2 cache, copies the
	  kernel, device tree and initramfs to their run addresses and
	  starts the kernel, listing each step on the LCD. Installed as
	  wt41n0-loader.bin in the images directory, where the post-image
	  script picks it up.

